ID:        RUSTSEC-2026-0190
Dependency tree:
anyhow 1.0.102
└── rslb-cli 0.1.0
exit=0

E14 result: reproduced. The recommended lockfile has no findings. The control,
which changes only the `anyhow` requirement, reports `RUSTSEC-2026-0190`; the
`>= 1.0.103` floor is therefore load-bearing.

