## Scope assessment

`review/DECISION.md` now states that the proposal executed no template runtime
behavior on any platform. It records AC1–AC8 and the associated signal, prompt,
crash-record, append-only, and build-size checks as unproven P03 work with
specified proof. That is correct under the 2026-09-10 research-only ruling; it
is not a missing implementation finding. E6 and E7 are explicitly labelled
source-interface findings, and E4 explicitly states its paired-control limit.
